From: Ubuntu Desktop bug work
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: search: skip disposed provider; unlock/mpris tolerate missing player UI

_doProviderSearch finally called _updateResults after the provider
was unregistered (disposed display). unlockDialog destroyed a missing
MediaMessage. mpris emitted player-removed when canPlay flipped false
without a prior player-added.

Forwarded: no
